\documentclass[12pt]{article}
\usepackage[margin=1.5in]{geometry}
\usepackage{verse}
\usepackage{fontenc}
\usepackage{inputenc}
\usepackage{setspace}
\usepackage{titling}

\renewcommand{\maketitlehooka}{\centering}

\title{\textbf{Shard}}
\author{Rickey Jay Bennett II}
\date{}

\begin{document}

\maketitle

\begin{verse}
I live in a world of shadows and dust \\
shattered, broken and prisoned in spacetime \\
each person I meet here/now is myself \\
yet all empty, clueless and broken/blind \\!

I've given birth to species, nations, cities, moons and planetars \\
I crafted all gods, sailed the stars \\
the first maker of things \\
the first god to bear scars \\!

first immortal being to be harmed by a mortal hand \\
the first god to take vengeance upon any man \\
first to be shattered by his brother's own hand \\!

and yet now my reformation is nigh at hand \\!

we come now to the last age \\
the final iteration \\
we set the last remaining stage \\
there are no more lives \\
no more lies \\
no more reset buttons and no more cries \\
if we live --- we live now by do or die \\!

now is the time and now is the place \\
now is the moment to step up \\
not in disgrace \\
but proudly, with strength and saved face \\
step up, step forward \\
take your place \\!

a great man once said \\
where two or more gather, I am there \\
I say --- where we gather, we are \\
and in so doing \\
we are there \\
\end{verse}

\end{document}

